{"kind":"html","caption":"从根结点开始：若当前结点有左子树，就找到左子树最右侧的结点，把原右子树接到它的右边，再把整棵左子树移到当前结点右边。随后沿新的 right 指针继续处理，动画用示例展示每次原地改线以及已确定的先序前缀。整个过程中 left 都被置为 null，最终得到顺序为 1 → 2 → 3 → 4 → 5 → 6 的单链表，额外空间为 O(1)。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>二叉树展开为链表</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}main{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px;display:grid;gap:8px}.panel{padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}h1{font-size:14px;margin:0 0 4px;font-weight:600}#step{color:#9cdcfe;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px}.rule{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#252526;font-size:12px}.layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px}.section-title{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}.tree{display:grid;gap:6px}.tree-row{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}.node{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#252526;text-align:center;transition:.35s}.node .value{font:14px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600}.node .label{display:block;margin-top:2px;font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d}.node.current{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}.node.pre{background:#473d18;border-color:#dcdcaa}.node.moved{background:#173b2c;border-color:#4ec9b0}.edge-note{display:flex;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;min-height:24px}.tag{padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;font-size:10px}.tag.blue{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}.action{min-height:auto;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;font-size:12px}.action strong{color:#3794ff}.pointers{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px}.pointer{padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;font-size:12px}.pointer span{display:block;color:#9cdcfe;margin-bottom:4px;font-size:10px}.pointer code{font:13px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#d4d4d4}.chain{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.cell{min-width:38px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#252526;text-align:center;font-size:12px}.cell .num{font:14px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600}.cell .ptrs{margin-top:2px;font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d}.cell.done{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}.arrow{color:#3794ff;font:12px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}.progress{height:3px;background:#3c3c3c;border-radius:3px;margin-top:8px}.bar{height:100%;background:#3794ff;border-radius:3px;transition:width .4s}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}.dot{display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;margin-right:4px;border-radius:3px;background:#0e639c;border:1px solid #3794ff}.dot.pre{background:#473d18;border-color:#dcdcaa}.dot.move{background:#173b2c;border-color:#4ec9b0}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<div class=\"top\"><h1>原地展开：把左子树插入右侧</h1><div id=\"step\">步骤 1 / 6</div></div>\n<div class=\"rule\">处理规则：当前结点有左子树时，先找左子树的最右结点 <b>前驱</b>；令“前驱.right = 原右子树”，再令“当前.right = 原左子树、当前.left = null”。</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"layout\">\n<div class=\"panel\">\n<h2 class=\"section-title\">当前结构（结点内显示角色）</h2>\n<div class=\"tree\">\n<div class=\"tree-row\"><div class=\"node\" data-v=\"1\"><div class=\"value\">1</div><span class=\"label\">结点</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"tree-row wide\"><div class=\"node\" data-v=\"2\"><div class=\"value\">2</div><span class=\"label\">左孩子</span></div><div class=\"node\" data-v=\"5\"><div class=\"value\">5</div><span class=\"label\">右孩子</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"tree-row\"><div class=\"node\" data-v=\"3\"><div class=\"value\">3</div><span class=\"label\">左孩子</span></div><div class=\"node\" data-v=\"4\"><div class=\"value\">4</div><span class=\"label\">右孩子</span></div><div class=\"node\" data-v=\"6\"><div class=\"value\">6</div><span class=\"label\">右孩子</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"edge-note\" id=\"edgeNotes\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel detail\">\n<h2 class=\"section-title\">本步改线</h2>\n<div class=\"action\" id=\"action\"></div>\n<div class=\"pointers\"><div class=\"pointer\"><span>当前结点 current</span><code id=\"current\">1</code></div><div class=\"pointer\"><span>左子树最右结点 pre</span><code id=\"pre\">4</code></div></div>\n<div class=\"legend\"><span><i class=\"dot\"></i>当前结点</span><span><i class=\"dot pre\"></i>前驱</span><span><i class=\"dot move\"></i>刚接入右链</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"panel chain-panel\">\n<h2 class=\"section-title\">已确定的先序链表前缀</h2>\n<div class=\"chain\" id=\"chain\"></div>\n<div class=\"progress\"><div class=\"bar\" id=\"bar\"></div></div>\n</section>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst steps=[\n{cur:1,pre:4,done:1,moved:[2,4,5],notes:['找到 1 的左子树最右结点：4'],text:'结点 <strong>1</strong> 有左子树。先沿 2 → 4 找到前驱 <strong>4</strong>，准备保存原来的右子树。'},\n{cur:1,pre:4,done:1,moved:[4,5],notes:['4.right ← 5','1.right ← 2','1.left ← null'],text:'执行三次改线：把原右子树 <strong>5</strong> 接到 4 后面，再把左子树 <strong>2</strong> 移到 1 的右边，并清空 1.left。'},\n{cur:2,pre:4,done:2,moved:[3,4],notes:['沿新的 right 到达 2','前驱仍为 4'],text:'沿新的 right 指针来到 <strong>2</strong>。它也有左子树，左子树只有结点 3，因此前驱是 <strong>3</strong>。',preOverride:3},\n{cur:2,pre:3,done:2,moved:[3,4],notes:['3.right ← 4','2.right ← 3','2.left ← null'],text:'把 2 原来的右子树 <strong>4</strong> 接到 3 后面，再把 <strong>3</strong> 移到 2 的右边，清空 2.left。'},\n{cur:3,pre:null,done:4,moved:[3,4],notes:['3、4 没有左子树','直接沿 right 前进'],text:'结点 <strong>3</strong> 和 <strong>4</strong> 都没有左子树，不需要改线；沿 right 继续即可。'},\n{cur:5,pre:null,done:6,moved:[5,6],notes:['5、6 没有左子树','所有 left 均为 null'],text:'最后经过 <strong>5 → 6</strong>。所有结点的 left 都是 null，right 链恰好保持原树的先序顺序。'}\n];\nconst values=[1,2,3,4,5,6];let index=0;\nfunction render(){const s=steps[index];document.getElementById('step').textContent=`步骤 ${index+1} / ${steps.length}`;document.getElementById('action').innerHTML=s.text;document.getElementById('current').textContent=s.cur??'—';document.getElementById('pre').textContent=s.preOverride??s.pre??'无需查找';document.querySelectorAll('.node').forEach(n=>{const v=Number(n.dataset.v);n.className='node';n.querySelector('.label').textContent='结点';if(v===s.cur){n.classList.add('current');n.querySelector('.label').textContent='current'}if(v===(s.preOverride??s.pre)){n.classList.add('pre');n.querySelector('.label').textContent='pre'}else if(s.moved.includes(v)){n.classList.add('moved')}});document.getElementById('edgeNotes').innerHTML=s.notes.map((x,i)=>`<span class=\"tag ${i===0?'blue':''}\">${x}</span>`).join('');document.getElementById('chain').innerHTML=values.map((v,i)=>`${i?'<span class=\"arrow\">→</span>':''}<div class=\"cell ${i<s.done?'done':''}\"><div class=\"num\">${v}</div><div class=\"ptrs\">left: null<br>right: ${i<values.length-1?values[i+1]:'null'}</div></div>`).join('');document.getElementById('bar').style.width=`${s.done/values.length*100}%`}\nrender();setInterval(()=>{index=(index+1)%steps.length;render()},2400);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":""}